    ("relaxed-is-global-sc", "C++ relaxed atomics impose one global sequentially consistent order", "Relaxed accesses remain atomic and obey their object's coherence requirements, but the two-variable store-buffering program can still produce double zero; the C++ SC order covers its designated SC actions.", "relaxed-access"),
