    ("publication-lifetime-boundary", "Publication does not finish the lifetime proof", "A matching acquire can order earlier initialization, but neither that order nor a successful CAS keeps storage alive. Reclamation, later mutation, valid aliasing, and ownership must be justified independently; a release sequence carrying a different object's pointer does not publish that object's unrelated construction.", "atomic-pointer-publication"),
